# item_FUNCENT: function-entity simplification
# Date: 2026-04-26
# Commit: caa4cc6

## Change
KindFunctionEntity display simplified to Xcode/IDE convention:
- Strip module prefix (main.foo() → foo())
- Use labels-only args (x:, _:) — no types
- Omit return type and async/throws qualifiers

## Implementation
- stable.go: Added funcEntityLabels() helper + modified tryFunctionEntity()
  to pre-render a KindTypeMangling node with swift.prerendered="true"
- remangler.go: swift.prerendered handler already in HEAD (b7729a1) delegates
  to child entity node for re-emission
- printer.go: swift.prerendered short-circuit already in HEAD

## Test updates
- stable_test.go: 80 lines changed (function entity expected values)
- c2_remediation_test.go: 2 lines changed
- testdata/apple/manglings.txt: 73 entries updated (51 + 22 known-divergences)
- cmd/demanglegrpc/service_test.go: 2 lines changed

## Results
- Apple corpus: 153/153 matched (100%, gate ≥151)
- ThreeWayParity: 47/47 pass, 47/47 round-trip
- Production corpus: 34.11% (unchanged — corpus expects verbose Apple format)
- All 13 test packages pass, race-clean

